In earlier submissions, people asked it to be in a separate
patch, so here it is.

Signed-off-by: Glauber Costa <glommer-bzQdu9zFT3WakBO8gow8eQ@public.gmane.org>
CC: Michal Hocko <mhocko-AlSwsSmVLrQ@public.gmane.org>
